      "value": "I believe the problem is even worse. I tried to log the playerId in OnPlayerLeft and it throws an exception. Accessing a public property should not throw an exception. In OnPlayerJoined I am able to log player.isMaster but again the playerId throws an exception. These should pass along full-formed player objects.",
