      "value": "@{614de6bab1382e4d89857763|full_name}: Thanks for confirming things. I think we can agree that if the player left then any attempt to fetch that player should return a null but... in OnPlayerJoined and Left a parameter is being passed representing the player. If that is going to be null it may as well not be passed and if it is an incomplete object it sounds like a bug as their is no way to know which properties work and which throw an exception. it isn't going to impact me... but :-)",
