      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just a quick note but someone mentioned the need to read the playerId at least once to me (like you mentioned). I do it in OnPlayerJoined now and I can log it in OnPlayerLeft.\n\nOh bad news. It only reports correctly to the other players and throws an exception on the player that left. So we have no way to check if a property get will throw an exception. Bummer.",
